<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ottawa Mechanical Keyboard Meetup 2026</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <nav class="container">
            <div class="logo">OMKM 2026</div>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#sponsors">Sponsors</a></li>
                <li><a href="#tickets" class="btn-nav">Get Tickets</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="container hero-content">
            <h1>Ottawa Mechanical Keyboard Meetup <span class="year">2026</span></h1>
            <p class="hero-tagline">Connecting enthusiasts, builders, and artisans in the Shawarma capital.</p>
            <div class="hero-details">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="icon">📅</span>
                    <span>May 16, 2026</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="icon">🕒</span>
                    <span>12pm - 5pm</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="icon">📍</span>
                    <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/rRB3KgA2w5UW2DmP7" target="_blank">Next Door Ottawa, 955A Gladstone Ave</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a href="#tickets" class="btn-primary">Get Your Tickets</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="about-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Experience the magic</h2>
            <p>Get ready for the biggest mechanical keyboard event in Ottawa! Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast with a collection of custom boards or just curious about what makes those clicks so satisfying, there's something for everyone.</p>
            <div class="event-info-grid">
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>What?</h3>
                    <p>Ottawa Mechanical Keyboard Meetup 2026</p>
                </div>
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>Where?</h3>
                    <p>Next Door Ottawa<br>955A Gladstone Ave, Ottawa</p>
                    <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/rRB3KgA2w5UW2DmP7" class="map-link" target="_blank">View on Google Maps</a>
                </div>
                <div class="info-card">
                    <h3>When?</h3>
                    <p>May 16, 2026<br>From 12pm - 5pm</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="sponsors" class="sponsors-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Our Sponsors</h2>
            <p class="section-desc">Special thanks to the amazing vendors making this event possible.</p>
            <div class="sponsor-grid">
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://mech.land", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/mechland.webp" alt="Mechland">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://www.nyxkeys.com", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/NyxKeys.png" alt="NyxKeys">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://beaverkeys.ca", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/BeaverKeys.png" alt="BeaverKeys">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://unikeyboards.com", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/Unikeys.png" alt="Unikeys">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://keybay.tech", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/KeyBay.png" alt="KeyBay">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://rndkbd.com", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/rndkbd.webp" alt="RndKbd">
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div class="sponsor-item">
                    <a href="https://www.etsy.com/shop/yasicrafts?utm_source=ig&utm_medium=social&utm_content=link_in_bio&dd_referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fl.instagram.com%2F", target="_blank">
                        <img src="assets/vendor-logos/IMG_0213.png" alt="Yasicrafts">
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


    <section id="tickets" class="cta-banner">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Ready to Click & Clack?</h2>
            <p>Tickets are limited. Secure yours now to join the ultimate keyboard experience.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn-cta">Buy Tickets Now</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Ottawa Mechanical Keyboard Meetup. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
